  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2abcb09abf0257c1838f9765",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "秋意渐近的中山，自称最快者聚集于此！\n电光火石・短途马锦标！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d4b41ecb6e1a6e253868930db6b5f969c8c9d19847af956ae0045220ed3a26d6",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "37"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:17328bfb4d04cf39d3e0613d",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "进入看台对面直线赛道的中间部分",
      "source_fingerprint": "c992bd7e06935470e9be880e70683280c9b252fbad1b8898e98a9a13596af4e7",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "370"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:feac4c5feb1cc5ee65a8efa2",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "接下来进入第二弯道",
      "source_fingerprint": "56ef8953264fe873e1d37cee61bf4280c4390f9614e2a64a298b5ac9fe71284b",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "372"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5b7df4a3261cb333a7766d84",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "秋华们为热闹的秋季增添色彩\n在秋华赏的舞台上华丽盛开的会是谁！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3edc45cc9b94a2daf3f59fcd1c0ee725a2c68d84c10547a38eebc947ff641366",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "38"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d4d60b62c6ebcbbbe8bcc01b",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "下了第三弯道的淀之坡！",
      "source_fingerprint": "41d16f86b843b1b8dfd9e914feb5c401935e22f5301a2fe76ab3a4d0804fe53f",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "385"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:afb28c7b0eccb646474f1136",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "越过大榉树，来到第四弯道",
      "source_fingerprint": "c1a05680d89c8fce099ebb4444b9d6d2de3674124ae12cd6ffdff9cf5ee0285f",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "386"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:52efc4e9caa2f0bfccd6a2cc",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "接下来就是坡道了！\n仁川的舞台以坡道为重点！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d525d3689c12d0fc57063fa73856ab848ff9a202aad696ef99d3dd13cabbe0bf",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "387"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4071eea7b31805ffe5125e71",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "来到「坎坷的福岛」，接下来将会如何呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "e28d7ed4b955a5cd824e6bd59d1f09119861a7828fd4304698d92cee0db37253",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "388"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:97bef7497d40d0f6344070ee",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "能感受到凉风吹拂的札幌之地",
      "source_fingerprint": "11db559aa6edd20bd0e2f5e21bff37495e58b53b8f971b7f1a39289d52ddcd96",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "389"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9387c2953193e6a14c9fb907",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "经典赛路线的终点\n制霸菊花赏，斩获最强之名的会是谁！",
      "source_fingerprint": "16b3aa065cfaae1e09324e58a7c9a9696f8042043b11c50ffb8c4611b1d7eab7",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "39"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:da3cdb7aab8b76af2189268f",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "越过第二弯道的小丘进入直线",
      "source_fingerprint": "cb7ef820f16690ba3e402d3f351ad8b1a136d80242679c47545075a0418471b2",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "390"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:12c4285bf812104741b44fc0",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "新潟的直线从现在开始才是关键！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ef454e3b6ced368e916fce71fe5228883710773dc7f6069a5b2001c5dbe17072",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "391"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6a844ead1a9eead0ce9035ed",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "现在位于第三弯道，桶狭间之点！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d09794cdf0ae6b7ac6ae475856f8619399b0a6e394e6e5408733e4be7591b5b6",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "392"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:802e41162106760b76fd8b5b",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "中山的直线赛道可是很短的！\n后面的马娘们还能赶得上吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "e6ecd2c1f271a592e68d9362ac54db2be055d93ce7a995d0a1f15319a75e39fc",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "393"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b5a8cdb92d21217aad97eff9",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "能感受到津轻海峡的凉风拍打脸颊的函馆跑道",
      "source_fingerprint": "761960520d0d2eb983ff721ae448dbd03a60137b2e7e5bff223a09a1df47412a",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "394"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dde9daf5eccc61d0d3368d6a",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "能从激烈的新星杯中夺得冠军的\n会是哪位赛马娘！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "baaa5e729e1df990b55e5a80ad2c7e84ec0d633eded9cf07a74b7c80f59acda5",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "395"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dfc94e97b4083898f3e6716d",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "现在从草地进入沙土赛道",
      "source_fingerprint": "73da2ebdde3a0ba8f25af4a09421815882ec2ff4a11e556b6ff7c758c6063525",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "396"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:85e33e2fa0c03afc44628fa3",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "%h_player，越过大榉树，前往第四跑道",
      "source_fingerprint": "deeecd8d3164f55929bab6d36fe4722e362f3ff1a6180173ead86b4a9b74225f",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "397"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a8964deb1677e7d7621aaf0b",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "赛马娘们都在追求的一面坚盾\n将锻炼出的脚力作为武器踏上通向荣光之路！\n天皇赏（秋）！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c2185f2a4159dbee140c08bbeb5d02f1937a8d906d2980694b95f020b0b31bcb",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "40"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:95d36670d9abd224e34aacb5",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "这位是无人可敌的人气第一\n%ban1%h_pop1",
      "source_fingerprint": "495c11199f9d78bd55d160848f8ed3c4b58915dbb9dc36b6ea06fdb8e85a90ee",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "4001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0f146c5e4aa2f05b61d6bb1e",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "备受瞩目的人气第一，%ban1%h_pop1",
      "source_fingerprint": "62c4ba47ff1c989ea127a59d2d6078878369b611cbbefd09372f5df9b28ea4cf",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "4002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:15fc49f96c7b9ad7a16e3089",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "实力毫不逊色\n人气第二是%ban1%h_pop2",
      "source_fingerprint": "37be6527ed808b03e515edd7b0b8c00e4f8bd5e25f2712105a7df825630697a6",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "4003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5ca00e19ef0288f4eaef0db6",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "备受瞩目的人气第二，%ban1%h_pop2",
